//! layer beside it. std::process drives the git plumbing.
//!
//! Deterministic: the same events always produce the same
//! commits, so re-exporting a log the branch already has is a
//! no-op (each event's sequence number is the dedup key). The
//! commit blob (event.pb) is authoritative; the message subject and
//! trailers are a human index for `git log`.

